## A Personal Note from Arpit

This project is my learning journey built in public. I'm sharing everything openly
because I believe in the power of community and open knowledge.

You're free to use this code however you want - build your portfolio, learn from it,
modify it, or even use it commercially. No legal complications, no strings attached!

If you find this helpful, I'd be grateful for:
- A star on the repository ⭐
- A mention or credit in your project
- A shoutout on social media
- A link back to https://github.com/arpitv970/portfolio-reboot

**This is NOT legally required** - it's just a humble request. Your success and
learning are what matter most. But credits help me grow and motivate me to keep
building in public and sharing knowledge with the community.

Happy coding, and thank you for being part of this journey!

